  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Capacity on Freedom of Religion or Belief within Media</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objectives of the projects: a) raise understanding and sensitivity among local journalists and editors who produce and work on news on freedom of religion or belief, b) develop awareness among victims of acts of violence based on religion or belief and minority and vulnerable groups on the importance of media influence in creating public opinion, and how to work with journalists and media outlets to create and cover positive news about minorities, and c) appreciate journalists who have produced and promoted diversity news in their work.</narrative>
  </description>
